Package: KCundercover
Title: Codebreaking and Secret Operations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Katelyn", "Callahan", , "kgc010@bucknell.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The KCundercover package contains two functions: one is a theme function called 'theme_KCundercover' and a helper function called 'betterthanfactoring'. A brand that corresponds with the theme function and a logo are also contained with in the KCundercover package. The overalll goal of the package is to assist users while creating visual graphs and factoring data sets for easy use in anaylsis.  
